  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ATNi Quarterly Progress Report to FCDO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity includes ATNi progress reports to FCDO for work completed under ATNi&apos;s current grant. This grant is a continuation of FCDO&apos;s long-standing core support to the ATNI under the NASC programme, itself building on the earlier Sustaining Action on Nutrition (SAN) grant (2018&#x2013;2023) and the original FCDO&#x2013;ATNF grant (2016&#x2013;2020). It sustains the overarching NASC outcome- that an increasing number of food businesses are held to account for their actions on nutrition and adopt more responsible practices, producing healthier, more nutritious foods, particularly for women and children &#x2014; and the associated impact of improved diets and reduced diet-related disease in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs).</narrative>
  </description>
